          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kilö ECHOTYON,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.1.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.1.2"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 1:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.1.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.1.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 1:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kikepar korenkwa kïlïkwï kïratyan akepel kanastinekwa lömïs. Chengöy pïnotï parenikwa osïwïyekwa akwane akuwur kïgh anka tïkwïl. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.1.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.1.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 1:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ngötu Sayon* onkït nyo kïmi keriköy, kikongityot nyinte nko pancha nyo mi para sapipun, akïkarkegh nko kö pö par nyo mi para mïnyanytin, kikongityot nko kanasyan nyo kïmi keriköy. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.1.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.1.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 1:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "GEN.19.24"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Tow 19:24",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ROM.9.29"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Rum 9:29",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Ntökimetuch ECHOTYON Kimuktoghin pikö walaka kïchïwïtyö, kitökikewur Yerusalem lökarpïs, le wölo kikida Sodoma nko Komora.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.1.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.1.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 1:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.1.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.1.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 1:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Atera ngölyonto ECHOTYON pöytoghi Sodoma nko Komora nyo mwowokwa. Alïma kïgh nyo netokwa Tororötïncha. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.1.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.1.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 1:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "AMO.5.21+AMO.5.22"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Amo 5:21-22",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Mwoghöy nyinte lö, “Olentekwa so omökan tïsöwekwa cho chang le chï oropkanïkwa? Kikïmïchanïn tïsöwo mökol cho kakïpelwanïn nko sunetko kyakikwa cho okwoghöch. Motïngetanye machat nyo pö kisön pö kir nko cho pö mökol nko cho pö ngaror. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.1.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.1.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 1:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ngo nyini kitepakwa lö opkanïn tïkuchoni löwïr otini opkonekwa otïkonu Konyan? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.1.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.1.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 1:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kopukwa kwïle tïsöwekwo. Kikïghöchachïn ngutogh pö tïkuchoni opelekwa. Melö tomukan omïkukönchini Ichontinekwa cho pö Relïn pö Arawa nko Sapatotinekwa* nko tuyotïnekwa cho oryomokwa ompö sowut. Kewur ngokikwa choni lömïs. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.1.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.1.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 1:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ghöchinanïn Ichontinekwa cho pö Relïn pö Arawa nko cho pö osiswekwa cho echön. Nïkisöch chane tya ompö ani. Momukanye osïtöy.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.1.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.1.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 1:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.1.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.1.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 1:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Kïrkegh kosyolökwa ewunekwo parak ompö saghat, kïmelö orosokwa, kïrkegh kamwaghakwa sowut cho tya, kïmelö olïman, ompöwölo nyïghitate kisön ewunekwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.1.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.1.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 1:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Owunö kegh atotïlilitunö, awirteghena wölo omitan ghöyityö, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.1.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.1.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 1:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "anet kegh agh tïkwïn cho tenote. Asïwa lö keghisyö ngala man, angaraka pich cho kireyöy atö pönon tïkukwa angarak mïsïktin.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.1.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.1.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 1:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.1.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.1.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 1:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lentöy ECHOTYON, “Apkana kengalana tïkwïl, kïrkegh köpïröch ngokikwa lötök, kemwötöy kïrelachitu löpöt. Kïrkegh köpïröch le pentera, keghöy kïrelachitu le puto kech. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.1.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.1.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 1:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omekwa tïkwïn cho karamach cho pkono korononi ato arïpakwa kïnye ngalechan. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.1.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.1.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 1:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wölo ato apenyakwa ngalecha, kewongenokwa chok lökörpïs.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.1.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.1.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Kanasyanta ngokï",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 1:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.1.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.1.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 1:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kötöpö onö kanasyantanï kighanate tökïlïkwï chepores! Kinyïghitate pipö man orinyi osiswe walaka, wölo köngötï ye nyu rïmï opïn. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.1.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.1.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 1:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kalïkwï ye nyu ropïyeniku samï, akïlïkwï dipayköku* chay karamach pögh kwïle. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.1.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.1.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 1:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kalïkwï pöytoghiku pich cho kichumpön akïlïkwï kongoti chorï. Toköy chane tïpö pich akïcham kerop chane. Melö syonchini pönon ompö ka kirwok anta chömchï mïsïktin kwipchï chane lokekwa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.1.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.1.23"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 1:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.1.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.1.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 1:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kïlenyona alïma kïgh nyo mwoghöy ECHOTYON Kimuktoghin, Tororöt pö Israel nyo awes lö, “Oghokunan ghöyityö wölo imitenyi, ato ngat. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.1.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.1.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 1:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oghan kïgh nko nyi, otïlilinyi le wölay kidoy karïn, apuktan sïmnyontengu kïmïkul. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.1.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.1.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 1:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Otöninan pöytoghiku kirurut cho kongityot nko cho kipö tagh. Kïkuro nyu Yerusalem kanasyan nyo pö man, nyo ghanate.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.1.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.1.26"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 1:26"
          },
